      "title": "http2: add PRIORITY_UPDATE frame dissection",
      "message": "http2: add PRIORITY_UPDATE frame dissection\n\nThe HTTP/2 priority update frame is an extension frame defined in\nhttps://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-httpbis-priority/.\n\nWith this change, we add new support for the frame to the HTTP/2\ndissection, matching the capability in the HTTP/3 dissector, to expose\nthe target of the priority and the value of the hint.\n",
      "author_name": "Lucas Pardue",
      "author_email": "lucaspardue.24.7@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2022-01-16T04:49:33.000+00:00",
      "committer_name": "A Wireshark GitLab Utility",
      "committer_email": "gerald+gitlab-utility@wireshark.org",
      "committed_date": "2022-01-16T22:13:49.000+00:00",
      "trailers": {},
      "extended_trailers": {},
